@startuml R3 出库单状态机
title 出库单状态机（OutboundStatus）
[*] --> DRAFT : 创建出库单\ncreateOrder()

DRAFT --> ALLOCATED : allocate()\n锁库存
DRAFT --> CANCELLED : cancel()

ALLOCATED --> PICKING : 生成拣货任务\ncreateTasks()
ALLOCATED --> CANCELLED : cancel()\n释放锁定

PICKING --> PICKED : 拣货全部完成\nconfirmPick()
PICKING --> CANCELLED : cancel()

PICKED --> PACKING : pack()\n复核打包
PICKED --> CANCELLED : cancel()

PACKING --> SHIPPED : ship()\n扣减库存+装车
PACKING --> CANCELLED : cancel()

SHIPPED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of ALLOCATED
  已锁定库存：
  StockFeignClient.lock()
  取消时 unlock()
end note

note right of SHIPPED
  发货时：
  unlock(planQty) + decrease(shipQty)
  生成 shipping_record(LOADED)
end note
@enduml
